  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>Best WordPress Alternatives in 2026</h1>
      <div class="meta">Updated July 2026 · Ranked 5 alternatives · Website Builder Pillar · CMS Category</div>

      <p>WordPress powers over 40% of the web, but it is not the best tool for every website. Plugin conflicts, security vulnerabilities, PHP maintenance, and hosting management drive many users to seek alternatives. In 2026, hosted platforms like Webflow, Squarespace, Wix, Framer, and Shopify deliver professional websites without server maintenance. We ranked them on design flexibility, SEO, pricing, ease of use, and how directly each replaces a specific WordPress weakness.</p>
      <p>For head-to-head breakdowns, see <a href="/reviews/wordpress-vs-webflow/">WordPress vs Webflow</a> and <a href="/reviews/framer-vs-webflow/">Framer vs Webflow</a>. Explore the <a href="/reviews/website-builder/">Website Builder Pillar</a> for more platform reviews.</p>

      <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-design-webflow">#1 — Webflow (Best for Designers & Developers)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-templates-squarespace">#2 — Squarespace (Best for Beautiful Templates)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-beginners-wix">#3 — Wix (Best for Beginners & Drag-and-Drop)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-interactive-framer">#4 — Framer (Best for Modern Interactive Sites)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-ecommerce-shopify">#5 — Shopify (Best for Ecommerce)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#selection-scenarios">Selection Scenarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#buying-guide">How to Choose</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <h2 id="quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Platform</th>
            <th>Best For</th>
            <th>Starting Price</th>
            <th>Free Tier</th>
            <th>Rating</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Webflow</strong></td>
            <td>Designers, developers</td>
            <td>$14/mo (Basic)</td>
            <td>Yes — 2 projects</td>
            <td>4.5/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Squarespace</td>
            <td>Templates, design-first</td>
            <td>$16/mo (Personal)</td>
            <td>14-day trial</td>
            <td>4.4/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Wix</td>
            <td>Beginners, drag-and-drop</td>
            <td>$17/mo (Business Basic)</td>
            <td>Yes — Wix-branded</td>
            <td>4.0/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Framer</td>
            <td>Modern, interactive sites</td>
            <td>$10/mo (Mini)</td>
            <td>Yes — 1 project</td>
            <td>4.3/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Shopify</td>
            <td>Ecommerce</td>
